#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0514 expect=violation domain=DM
#note "S3 foreign discrimination (SKELETON-distinct-function hazard 3: under domain=\"TA\" the ARM column is TA's, not the primary DM's). Authority: SDTM and SDTMIG Conformance Rules v2.0 CG0514 (SDTMIG 3.3/3.4), Condition \"Study does not use multi-stage arm assignments and ACTARM ^= null\", Rule \"ACTARM in TA.ARM\". The fixture models a single-stage study (one randomisation, every arm fully defined in TA), so the Condition's multi-stage clause holds and every flagged row is an authority violation (Partially Executable: that clause is not evaluated, status file P0-4). Row 1: DM.ARM='Drug C' and ACTARM='Drug C', TA does not define it -> fires. Row 2: ACTARM='Drug B' is a TA.ARM (treated off-plan, which CG0514 does not judge) -> silent. A port that read ARM from DM would build {Drug C, Drug A}: row 1 silent and row 2 firing, so the exact-set pin reds in both directions."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 USUBJID=S-001 ACTARM="Drug C"
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ARMCD    type=Char label="Planned Arm Code"
col ARM      type=Char label="Description of Planned Arm"
col ACTARMCD type=Char label="Actual Arm Code"
col ACTARM   type=Char label="Description of Actual Arm"
col ARMNRS   type=Char label="Reason Arm and/or Actual Arm is Null"
---
STUDY01 | DM | S-001 | C | Drug C | C | Drug C |
STUDY01 | DM | S-002 | A | Drug A | B | Drug B |
STUDY01 | DM | S-003 | A | Drug A | A | Drug A |
---

dataset TA label="Trial Arms"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ARMCD   type=Char label="Planned Arm Code"
col ARM     type=Char label="Description of Planned Arm"
col TAETORD type=Num  label="Planned Order of Element within Arm"
col ETCD    type=Char label="Element Code"
col ELEMENT type=Char label="Description of Element"
col EPOCH   type=Char label="Epoch"
---
STUDY01 | TA | A | Drug A | 1 | SCRN | Screening | SCREENING
STUDY01 | TA | A | Drug A | 2 | DRGA | Drug A    | TREATMENT
STUDY01 | TA | B | Drug B | 1 | SCRN | Screening | SCREENING
STUDY01 | TA | B | Drug B | 2 | DRGB | Drug B    | TREATMENT
---
